    {
     "type": "textmedia",
     "header": "",
     "body": "<h4>Implementing automatic data transfer and selection</h4> <p>After several test runs and analyses, an effective strategy was developed. NC programs were assigned based on the first eight digits of the QR code, which served as a common identifier for part groups. Using this identifier, »zidCode« could automatically select the correct NC program on the CNC control with keyboard simulation. It eliminated manual program selection completely, preventing associated errors from incorrect program selection like rejected parts or damaged machinery.</p>",
