    {
     "type": "textmedia",
     "header": "",
     "body": "<h4>Streamlining parts machining</h4> <p>By implementing »zidCode«, the customer achieved:</p><ul><li>Faster setup and changeover processes </li><li>Increased machining process reliability and security</li><li>Reduced dependency on operator knowledge </li><li>A scalable solution for future part variants</li></ul>",
